Experiment: connected de Bruijn graph CP-SAT search
Date: 2026-09-02
Machine: Apple M4 Pro, arm64, macOS
Solver: OR-Tools CP-SAT 9.15.6755

Purpose:
  Search for a valid cyclic binary radius-1 covering sequence through its
  order-8 de Bruijn edge multiplicities. Decode every feasible count vector
  as an Euler circuit and verify the resulting bit sequence independently of
  the solver's auxiliary variables.

