Exact formulations:
  flow:
    single-commodity root flow on selected edges
  tree:
    selected parent arcs with strictly increasing root depth
  cuts:
    repeated solution, component detection, and sound entering-edge cuts

Strengthening:
  disjoint zero-covering anchor cases
  exact support-size stages
  at-most-length constructive mode
  explicit minimum-support constraint
  radius-1 Van Wee inequalities
  Hamming-weight layer inequalities
  repeated-edge support-defect budget

