Anchor-256 scope:
  In the disjoint partition, anchor 256 forces all earlier words in
  B_1(0^9) absent. Edge 256 enters vertex 0, while both outgoing edges 0 and 1
  are absent, contradicting balance. This excludes only that partitioned
  distinct-support anchor case.

